WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.928
Brad: It’s recess time.

2
00:00:03.929 --> 00:00:05.899
Tina: Is everything okay?

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.134
Brad: Yeah, you were making strange noises.

4
00:00:09.136 --> 00:00:12.287
We saw you moving like a jumping bean. Danny:

5
00:00:12.288 --> 00:00:14.498
You didn’t see him? Tina

6
00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:18.088
& Brad: See who? Danny:

7
00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:22.459
Well, I saw him and I know he’s real!

8
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.050
Brad: Who’s real?

9
00:00:25.051 --> 00:00:27.211
Danny: Aha! It’s here!

10
00:00:27.212 --> 00:00:28.882
He left the clay for me.

11
00:00:28.883 --> 00:00:31.851
Tina: Danny, you’re acting really weird.

12
00:00:31.852 --> 00:00:42.193
Danny: Let’s go! Follow me to our secret place! Hurry!

13
00:00:42.194 --> 00:00:44.931
You guys have to listen to me. Tina:

14
00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:46.772
Okay. Danny:

15
00:00:46.773 --> 00:00:48.923
And believe me. Brad:

16
00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:53.123
Well, that depends on what you say. Danny:

17
00:00:53.124 --> 00:00:56.618
Okay. I just had a visit. Brad:

18
00:00:56.619 --> 00:00:59.351
You were asleep at your desk. Danny:

19
00:00:59.352 --> 00:01:02.218
No, no. Just listen─

20
00:01:02.219 --> 00:01:04.983
Brad: Well, you’re not making any sense.

21
00:01:04.984 --> 00:01:07.982
Tina: Brad, just listen to Danny.

22
00:01:07.983 --> 00:01:12.652
Danny: Thank you. My visitor was a giant named Hopian.

23
00:01:12.653 --> 00:01:15.034
We have to go to his world. It’s

24
00:01:15.035 --> 00:01:17.179
called Ginormous. We

25
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:26.580
have to bring back the lost color to his world. Tina: That’s

26
00:01:26.581 --> 00:01:28.756
a good one, Danny! Brad: And

27
00:01:28.757 --> 00:01:31.868
you were so serious the whole time! Tina: A

28
00:01:31.869 --> 00:01:33.750
giant! Brad: Bring

29
00:01:33.751 --> 00:01:36.790
back the lost color! Danny: I’m

30
00:01:36.791 --> 00:01:39.604
serious! Brad:

31
00:01:39.605 --> 00:01:44.311
Danny, you had a dream about art class. That’s all. Tina:

32
00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:47.847
You have got the wildest imagination. Danny:

33
00:01:47.848 --> 00:01:51.644
That’s what Hopian said! Tina:

34
00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:56.520
Sorry, Danny. But I’d rather play soccer than listen to this. Danny:

35
00:01:56.521 --> 00:01:59.051
No, I’ve got proof. Hopian

36
00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.429
gave me something. Brad:

37
00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:04.443
A map to his magic giant land? Danny:

38
00:02:04.444 --> 00:02:10.903
No. I wish it was a map, though. Here. Brad:

39
00:02:10.904 --> 00:02:12.874
What’s that? Danny:

40
00:02:12.875 --> 00:02:15.258
It’s clay from Hopian’s world. It’s

41
00:02:15.259 --> 00:02:18.167
going to help us get there.

42
00:02:18.168 --> 00:02:23.934
Brad: That’s just the clay from art class.

43
00:02:23.935 --> 00:02:26.205
Tina: This clay is glowing, Brad.

44
00:02:26.206 --> 00:02:31.491
That clay didn’t glow.

45
00:02:31.492 --> 00:02:33.845
Danny: What is it?

46
00:02:33.846 --> 00:02:38.782
Brad: This clay is not from our world.

